          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;I found BCP691 ALSA Geotour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After finding the nearby lab cache I came over here.  I found the cap while it was sprinkling but as I was taking my photos it just started to pour.  When I got back in the vehicle, Mrs. Gumby just laughed at me.  Thanks for the cap in this great spot.  TFTBC  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

